    q(33,"Pyelonephritis patient case","LB has fever, flank pain, nausea, and costovertebral-angle tenderness. Urine E. coli is susceptible to nitrofurantoin and levofloxacin but resistant to ampicillin and TMP-SMX. Which drug is more appropriate?",("Nitrofurantoin","Levofloxacin","Ampicillin","Either nitrofurantoin or levofloxacin"),(1,),"Levofloxacin reaches kidney tissue; nitrofurantoin is inappropriate for pyelonephritis.","Flank pain needs kidney penetration."),
